~ 4x^3#This reverses or misuses the parts of the rational exponent. In a^m/n, n is the root index and m is the power on the radicand.
~ x^1/4#This reverses or misuses the parts of the rational exponent. In a^m/n, n is the root index and m is the power on the radicand.
}

